description	"Jek Tono Porkins aka 'Piggy'

I'm a big man. A big, BIG man.

^2Weaponry:
- Limited Melee
-- 90% more Kb
-- 15% slower RoF
- Porkins' S3 Blaster Pistol (EE-3 1)
-- 75% faster RoF
-- 30% less Dmg
-- 20% less FP Dmg
-- 100% slower Rld
- CR-1 Blast Cannon (Shotgun 3)
-- 20% more Vel
-- 10% more Dmg
-- 10% more FP Dmg
-- 100% slower Rld
- Emergency Eject (Conc Rifle 1)
-- 50% faster Shot Swap
-- 100% less Dmg
-- Sec only

^6Inventory:
- Defense Seeker ^3[CS1]
- Medpac ^3[CS3]
- Personal Energy Shield ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Strength (1)
- Melee Resist
